---
layout: base.njk
title: "FAQ — Booking, Rewards, Parking & More | Polished Nail Bar DTLA"
description: "Answers on booking, choosing a nail tech, cash rewards, validated parking, walk-ins, gift cards and group bookings."
permalink: /faq/
---
<section class="masthead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="u10 mute">FAQ · {{ site.name }}</span>
    <h1 class="mega">Before<br>your visit</h1>
    <p class="lead">Booking, rewards, parking and everything else people ask at the desk. Still stuck? Call, text or email — details at the bottom.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% for g in faq.groups %}
<section class="sec wrap"{% if not loop.first %} style="padding-top:0"{% endif %}>
  <div class="sh rv">
    <div class="top"><span class="u10 mute">{{ "0" + (loop.index | string) }} — {{ g.heading }}</span></div>
    <h2 class="big">{{ g.heading }}</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="acc rv">
    {%- for q in g.items %}
    <div class="acc-i{% if loop.first and g.items.length %} open{% endif %}">
      <button class="acc-b" type="button" aria-expanded="{{ 'true' if loop.first else 'false' }}">{{ q.question }}<span class="sg"></span></button>
      <div class="acc-p"><p>{{ q.answer | safe }}</p></div>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endfor %}

<section class="sec wrap" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="dl rv">
    <div><dt>Still have a question?</dt><dd>
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phone_link }}">Call {{ site.phone_display }}</a> ·
      <a href="sms:{{ site.text_link }}">Text {{ site.text_display }}</a> ·
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></dd></div>
  </div>
  <div class="btns"><a class="btn" href="{{ site.booking_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book an appointment</a></div>
</section>
